  "details": "<p>BAtlas included Pandirippu, marking it as \"a modern settlement associated with an exceptional cultural feature beyond the area of Greek and Roman settlement.\"</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "A settlement in eastern Sri Lanka that was reported in the early 20th century to have been the findspot of one, and maybe a few more, Roman bronze coins of the fourth century. Walburg suspects that this reported provenance may be incorrect.",
